---
// WhyUs.astro — El Manifiesto del Atelier (Vibrant Multi-Color)
---

<section class="section why-us" id="nosotros" aria-labelledby="whyus-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why-us__grid">
      <!-- Left Visual -->
      <div class="why-us__visual reveal">
        <div class="why-us__img-wrap">
          <img
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2544829/pexels-photo-2544829.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=900&h=1200&dpr=1"
            alt="Chef del atelier sellando medallones de Wagyu sobre plancha de hierro fundido"
            class="why-us__img"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="why-us__badge">
            <span class="why-us__badge-icon">⚡</span>
            <span class="why-us__badge-title">EL ARTE DEL FUEGO</span>
            <span class="why-us__badge-sub">Sin conservantes. 100% Pasión artesanal.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Content -->
      <div class="why-us__content reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="eyebrow">NUESTRA DOCTRINA</span>
        <span class="gold-line"></span>
        <h2 class="display-heading why-us__heading" id="whyus-heading">
          El Manifiesto<br /><span class="highlight-flame">del Atelier</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="why-us__intro">
          No somos una hamburguesería convencional. Somos un laboratorio de sabor donde la técnica francesa, las brasas argentinas y el marmoleo del Wagyu convergen en una sola meta: el bocado definitivo.
        </p>

        <div class="why-us__pillars" role="list">
          <!-- Pillar 1: Flame -->
          <div class="why-pillar why-pillar--flame" role="listitem">
            <span class="why-pillar__num">01</span>
            <div class="why-pillar__body">
              <h3 class="why-pillar__title">Blend Secreto 100% Wagyu</h3>
              <p class="why-pillar__desc">Selección estricta de cortes nobles con un 28% de grasa intramuscular. Picado en frío diario para preservar la estructura celular y retener todos los jugos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pillar 2: Saffron -->
          <div class="why-pillar why-pillar--saffron" role="listitem">
            <span class="why-pillar__num">02</span>
            <div class="why-pillar__body">
              <h3 class="why-pillar__title">Fermentación Lenta de 48 Horas</h3>
              <p class="why-pillar__desc">Nuestros panes brioche de papa nacen de una masa madre viva cultivada desde 2018. Horneados dos veces por turno con manteca clarificada.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pillar 3: Mint -->
          <div class="why-pillar why-pillar--mint" role="listitem">
            <span class="why-pillar__num">03</span>
            <div class="why-pillar__body">
              <h3 class="why-pillar__title">La Reacción de Maillard a 300°C</h3>
              <p class="why-pillar__desc">Smasheamos con prensas de hierro macizo sobre superficies ardientes para provocar una caramelización profunda y crujiente, con centro sedoso.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pillar 4: Violet -->
          <div class="why-pillar why-pillar--violet" role="listitem">
            <span class="why-pillar__num">04</span>
            <div class="why-pillar__body">
              <h3 class="why-pillar__title">Quesos de Autor & Afinados Propios</h3>
              <p class="why-pillar__desc">Desde Cheddar inglés añejado 18 meses hasta Morbier francés y provoletas artesanales de masa hilada fundidas a temperatura exacta.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.why-us {
  background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.why-us__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
  gap: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  align-items: center;
}

.why-us__visual { position: relative; }

.why-us__img-wrap {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
}

.why-us__img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: brightness(0.9) contrast(1.1);
  transition: transform 0.8s ease;
}

.why-us__img-wrap:hover .why-us__img { transform: scale(1.04); }

.why-us__badge {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 1.75rem;
  left: 1.75rem;
  right: 1.75rem;
  background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.92);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.35);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.3rem;
}

.why-us__badge-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; }

.why-us__badge-title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #FFFFFF;
}

.why-us__badge-sub {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
}

.why-us__content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

.why-us__heading {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.highlight-flame {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-style: italic;
  background: var(--grad-flame);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

.why-us__intro {
  font-size: var(--fs-md);
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  line-height: var(--lh-loose);
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.why-us__pillars { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }

.why-pillar {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  transition: transform var(--transition-base);
}

.why-pillar:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
.why-pillar:hover { transform: translateX(8px); }

.why-pillar__num {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  padding-top: 0.15rem;
}

/* Pillar Multi-Color Numbers */
.why-pillar--flame .why-pillar__num   { color: #FF5722; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.4); }
.why-pillar--saffron .why-pillar__num { color: #FFB703; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.4); }
.why-pillar--mint .why-pillar__num    { color: #06D6A0; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6, 214, 160, 0.4); }
.why-pillar--violet .why-pillar__num  { color: #8B5CF6; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); }

.why-pillar__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
}

.why-pillar__desc {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-weight: 400;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .why-us__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
